---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LinkBar from "../components/LinkBar.astro";
import BibtexBlock from "../components/BibtexBlock.astro";
import MethodologyFigure from "../components/MethodologyFigure.astro";
import LimitationPresenceChart from "../components/LimitationPresenceChart.astro";
import LiveAnnotationDemo from "../components/LiveAnnotationDemo.astro";
import { authors, affiliations, paper } from "../data/paper";
---
<BaseLayout title={`${paper.title} — NLP Limitations`}>
  <h1>{paper.title}</h1>

  <p class="authors">
    {authors.map((author, i) => (
      <>
        <span>{author.name}<sup>{author.affiliation === "chula" ? "†" : "‡"}{author.corresponding ? "*" : ""}</sup></span>
        {i < authors.length - 1 ? ", " : ""}
      </>
    ))}
  </p>
  <p class="affiliations">
    <span><sup>†</sup> {affiliations.chula}</span> &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <span><sup>‡</sup> {affiliations.google}</span>
  </p>

  <div class="venue-strip">
    <span class="venue-pill">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" class="venue-icon">
        <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path>
        <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path>
      </svg>
      {paper.venue}
    </span>
  </div>

  <LinkBar />

  <div class="tldr">
    <div class="tldr-title">
      <span class="tldr-badge">TL;DR</span>
    </div>
    <p class="tldr-text">
      This paper analyzed Limitations sections from <strong>16,067 ACL and EMNLP papers</strong> to understand their trends over time, their correlations with paper attributes, and the rhetorical strategies researchers use to present them.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Abstract</h2>
  <p>{paper.abstract}</p>

  <h2>Methodology</h2>
  <p>
    A human-AI pipeline alternates between an LLM proposing codes for each
    sentence and a researcher reviewing any genuinely new category it
    surfaces. Hover a stage of the actual pipeline figure for details:
  </p>
  <MethodologyFigure />
  <p class="section-cta">
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}methodology`}>Full methodology walkthrough &rarr;</a>
  </p>

  <LiveAnnotationDemo />

  <h2>Dataset</h2>
  <p>
    This site's <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}explore`}>explorer</a> covers
    the <strong>16,047-paper LLM-coded dataset</strong> — every ACL/EMNLP main and
    Findings paper (2020–2025) with a Limitations section, coded with sentence-level
    evidence spans and justifications.
  </p>

  <h3>Inter-annotator agreement</h3>
  <p>
    To make sure the LLM's coding is trustworthy, it was validated against a
    separate <strong>150-paper reference set</strong> independently coded by
    four expert human annotators (that reference set isn't separately
    browsable here, since a few of its papers come from small workshop
    tracks outside this site's ACL/EMNLP main+Findings scope).
  </p>
  <p class="iaa-numbers">
    <span class="badge badge-human">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="vertical-align: -2px;">
        <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
        <path d="M5.5 21a8.38 8.38 0 0 1 13 0"></path>
      </svg>
      Human annotators only
    </span>
    <strong>α = 0.644</strong>
    <span class="iaa-arrow">&rarr;</span>
    <span class="badge badge-llm">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="vertical-align: -2px;">
        <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="10" rx="2"></rect>
        <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2"></circle>
        <path d="M12 7v4"></path>
        <line x1="8" y1="16" x2="8.01" y2="16"></line>
        <line x1="16" y1="16" x2="16.01" y2="16"></line>
      </svg>
      + LLM as a coder
    </span>
    <strong>α = 0.647</strong>
  </p>
  <p>
    Agreement barely changes when the LLM is added as a fifth coder — the
    basis for treating its coding of the remaining ~16,000 papers as
    reliable.
  </p>
  <p class="section-cta">
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}results`}>See the full per-code agreement breakdown &rarr;</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Results</h2>

  <h3>Limitations section adoption</h3>
  <p>
    A Limitations section was optional until EMNLP 2022 and ACL 2023 made it
    mandatory. Adoption jumped almost immediately from single digits to
    effectively 100%:
  </p>
  <LimitationPresenceChart />

  <p class="section-cta">
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}results`}>Full results: most common limitations, temporal trends &amp; homogeneity &rarr;</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Citation</h2>
  <BibtexBlock />

  <p class="cta">
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}explore`}>Explore the dataset &rarr;</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .authors {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .affiliations {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .venue-strip {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .venue-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #eff6ff;
    color: #1d4ed8;
    border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .venue-icon {
    color: #2563eb;
  }

  .tldr {
    background: #f0f9ff;
    border: 1px solid #bae6fd;
    border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
  }
  .tldr-title {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .tldr-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #0284c7;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 0.12rem 0.48rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .tldr-text {
    margin: 0;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  h3 {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #1e293b;
  }

  .iaa-numbers {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .badge-human {
    background: #ecfdf5;
    color: #065f46;
    border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
  }
  .badge-llm {
    background: #f5f3ff;
    color: #5b21b6;
    border: 1px solid #ddd6fe;
  }

  .iaa-arrow { color: var(--color-muted); }
  .section-cta { font-weight: 600; }
  .cta { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
